          "filename": "The Sweetest Capitol in the Philippines.jpg",
          "caption": "The Negros Occidental Capitol was built in 1927 and was finished in 1933, six (6) years in the making. It came out to be beautiful, as sweet as the sugar in the province. This is the government center of the Province of Negros Occidental, standing proud as a living witness of Negros Occidental's glorious past. The capitol has a neoclassical design that makes it more prominent and classy.",
